Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.47,0:00:08.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't there be more fabric?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.51,0:00:10.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's pretty standard.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.60,0:00:16.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Hinata will like this one...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Bell. Be confident!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.36,0:00:22.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.67,0:00:28.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.01,0:00:31.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The summers in this world are brutal.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.75,0:01:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's even worse than usual this year.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.63,0:01:56.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.34,0:01:58.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's too hot to walk!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.41,0:02:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-We're almost home, so hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.28,0:02:04.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Why are you\Navoiding me all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.31,0:02:06.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.75,0:02:10.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that I'm\Nhyperaware of her now!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.94,0:02:20.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it... You are avoiding me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.94,0:02:23.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-You surprised me just now, is all!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then give me a big hug!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.15,0:02:29.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make it even hotter than\Nthis stupid weather!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.20,0:02:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um... Maybe we shouldn't in public...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.83,0:02:35.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Why not?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.66,0:02:37.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.09,0:02:40.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the beach on our next day off!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.84,0:02:42.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The beach?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.34,0:02:43.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.28,0:02:48.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect weather for it,\Nand I think it'd be a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.31,0:02:54.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm sure Sunohara would be thrilled\Nto see you wearing a cute swimsuit, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.55,0:02:57.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A cute swimsuit...?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look so sexy like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.91,0:03:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't... hold back any longer!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.43,0:03:13.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've finally decided to be\Nhonest with yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hinata! Right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.91,0:03:17.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we go now, it'd be getting dark out\Nby the time we arrive.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.49,0:03:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then when can we go?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next Sunday, maybe?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to go swimsuit shopping, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure to get my good side!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, slow down!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ended up here after all...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.02,0:03:47.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.44,0:03:49.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mhm, it's tasty.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not the shaved ice.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was talking about my swimsuit.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.42,0:04:01.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take a good... long... hard look.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell... Stop, a lot of people\Nare watching us...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.17,0:04:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I chose this swimsuit\Nespecially for you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.21,0:04:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I look much tastier than shaved ice, don't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.38,0:04:19.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh... W-Well, you aren't food,\Nso I don't know about "tasty"...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.72,0:04:21.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.19,0:04:24.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's strawberry-flavored.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want a taste?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, don't be swayed!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You swore you were going to do this right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.57,0:04:38.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you not like my swimsuit...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.32,0:04:40.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.13,0:04:45.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not your cup of tea?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what about this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.88,0:04:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.42,0:04:54.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me which style you prefer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.71,0:04:59.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll wear anything you\Nwant me to wear, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.05,0:05:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even something like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.93,0:05:06.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, which one's your favorite?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.15,0:05:11.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Using magic on a crowded beach?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.44,0:05:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to annoy Lord Hinata again?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You just had to tag along...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you to decide how he feels?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.74,0:05:23.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.76,0:05:28.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wanna play beach volleyball with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Volleyball?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.99,0:05:33.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pass. I might get a sunburn.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.79,0:05:37.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let me put some sunscreen on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.64,0:05:41.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good idea! Nobody likes\Na sunburn, am I right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.14,0:05:43.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Will you put sunscreen on—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.28,0:05:46.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I gotta go to the bathroom!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.39,0:05:49.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.03,0:05:52.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's slather it on there!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oof, you're tense, Cecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.90,0:05:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Working in an office is tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.31,0:06:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have just the prettiest skin, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's as radiant as a gem!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.47,0:06:05.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hinata said the same thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's avoiding me, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.83,0:06:12.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I annoying him...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does he need space...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.14,0:06:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura! What was that for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going soft on me, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.67,0:06:23.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.97,0:06:26.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and Sunohara are\Ndestined for each other, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember what you told me before?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.01,0:06:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I'll never leave Hinata's side ever again."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.31,0:06:39.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hearing you say that really inspired me!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.83,0:06:41.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.35,0:06:46.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Knowing Sunohara, it'll all work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my hand slipped...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's dripping everywhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.25,0:06:57.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you wipe it off?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.77,0:07:00.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? I'll grab a towel!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.01,0:07:07.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mariabell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit laughing and help us!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mm, smells good!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks yummy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer and they'll be done.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.68,0:07:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A barbeque at the beach...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.21,0:07:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is pretty nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.38,0:07:42.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got grilled shrimp, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want some, Lord Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, uh, sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.01,0:07:55.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have some, thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. I'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.02,0:08:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-Don't pull too hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This should take care of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.41,0:08:15.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who'da thunk that thing was alive?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.34,0:08:19.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where are Mariabell and Lord Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Bell. What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.23,0:08:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's acting weird, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's like you've been avoiding\Nbeing alone with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.39,0:08:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't actually want to\Ncome to the beach, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.51,0:08:40.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's either that, or...\Ndo you really not like me anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.36,0:08:41.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.77,0:08:43.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.44,0:08:44.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.11,0:08:48.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you could never hate me, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.43,0:08:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And even if you somehow did hate me,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.13,0:08:54.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you would never, ever\Navoid me like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.72,0:08:56.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.41,0:09:01.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can tell that something's been\Nbothering you lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.77,0:09:06.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I can tell that it has\Nsomething to do with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.35,0:09:10.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But listen, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.07,0:09:16.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't stand to see you suffer\Nbecause of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're my whole world.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.90,0:09:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No... I care more about you\Nthan I do myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.10,0:09:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A little intense like always,\Nbut also... kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.13,0:09:34.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.91,0:09:36.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel better now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.84,0:09:37.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.87,0:09:38.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.91,0:09:42.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.29,0:09:50.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-Well, we should probably head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.39,0:09:54.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about we... make up first?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Make up, as in...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.80,0:10:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You had me worried, so...\NI could use some reassurance.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-We can't, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.33,0:10:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you don't hate me, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.93,0:10:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I... have to do things right!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll do it right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.72,0:10:15.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's wrap it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we try swimming\Nfurther out together?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.59,0:10:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Race you guys to that rock over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ready... go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.49,0:10:39.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not surprising for an adventurer\Nwho defeated the Demon Lord...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should go, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.36,0:10:48.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.18,0:10:53.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is...\NI have a confession to make.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.63,0:10:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I... can't swim.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.63,0:11:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:23.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(173,508)}Showers
